it mochte ich Informatik, weil die Projekte so spannend waren. Mein Englischlehrer hat mir geholfen, weil mein Deutsch damals schlecht war. Heute besuche ich einen Deutschkurs und sammle Erfahrung, weil das Handwerk viel Vorbereitung braucht. Ehrlich, ich freue mich auf die Zukunft, weil ich jetzt ein Ziel habe.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Warum Grafiker?","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Kilian, warum läufst du jeden Morgen?","speaker":"Rieke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Weil ich fit bleiben will und der Kopf danach frei ist.","speaker":"Kilian","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und warum malst du so oft, Rieke?","speaker":"Kilian","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Weil es mich entspannt und ich neue Farben mag.","speaker":"Rieke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Kilian, warum läufst du jeden Morgen?","speaker":"Rieke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-4-weil","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Weil ich fit bleiben will und der Kopf danach frei ist. Und warum malst du so oft, Rieke?","speaker":"Kilian","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_004_L002",